<<getouticon>><<link [[返回杂役水牌 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 11 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
圣骨廊的夜来得比别处早。太阳一落到城墙后头，那条夹在回廊与地窖之间的窄道就暗了下来，两盏灯挂在石壁上，灯油只够烧到半夜。守夜的人要坐在廊口的矮凳上，不能靠骨龛，不能出声，也不能让灯灭。管这片的老修女把一段打好的灯芯交给你：「若灯焰发甜，别闻，先去叫门房。那是油里混了东西。」
<br><br>
约旦在廊另一头跪着，膝下垫了一块旧毡。他/她今夜不诵经，只把手拢在袖子里，像在听墙里的水声。过了子时，廊顶传来极轻的脚步，走几步，停一停，又走几步，像有人在上面找一块松动的石板。灯焰被不知哪儿来的风拉得歪了一下，又直起来。你听见地窖深处有绳子摩擦石沿的声响，一慢一快，最后停了。
<br><br>
按规矩，整点的钟若没有响，守夜的人要自己去拉钟绳。钟绳在廊尾的窄梯上，梯级很陡，摸黑走容易踩空。你也可以先把灯添满，再回去坐着——灯油够，至少能看清脚下的路。老修女临走前又回头说：「守夜不是熬时间。你得让该睡的人睡得着，让不该醒的东西以为这里没人。」
<br><br>
地窖里的水声一直没有停，只是有时近，有时远。你把灯芯挑高了一点，光晕扩到骨龛边缘，照见石板上被人用指甲划出的几道浅痕，横着三道，竖着一道，像是某种计数。约旦在廊那头轻轻咳了一声，提醒你别盯着墙看。廊顶的脚步又响起来，这次走到你头顶就停了；隔了很久，才有一粒碎石从缝里落下来，掉在灯罩上，叮的一声。你抬头，只看见一片黑。灯油的气味变得有点甜，你想起老修女的话，立刻把灯挪远，又用袖子扇了扇。钟绳在窄梯尽头垂着，绳结被手汗浸得发亮，像一条等了很多年的蛇。你没有伸手。廊下的风一阵紧一阵松，灯焰跟着矮下去又立起来；你把披肩裹紧，听见自己的呼吸在石壁之间来回碰，像另一个人坐在暗处。
<br><br>
<<sneakicon>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($athletics or 0) gte 260>><<link [[持灯守夜 (0:14)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 14>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[持灯守夜 (0:14)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 14>><<stress 6>><<tiredness 4>><<pain 1>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 180>><<link [[续满守夜灯 (0:08)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<money -180>><<pass 8>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">续满守夜灯 (0:08)（钱不够）</span><</if>><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回杂役水牌 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 12 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
后院的净火池是一口浅底石槽，平时盖着铁栅，月初和节前才开。天刚亮，炭床已经被烧得发白，热气把空气顶得微微发颤。想求一个明白的人会脱了鞋，从池子这头走到那头，再由守在旁边的修士记下姓名。管火的修女说，火不认人，认的是炭床铺得平不平；铺得平，走过去只是烫，铺得偏，脚一陷就会留疤。
<br><br>
今天来的是一个年轻的朝圣者，裤脚卷到膝盖，手里攥着一块磨圆的石片。他/她站在池边，先伸一只脚试了试，又缩回去。约旦站在铁栅旁，没有催促，只说：「想清楚再走。走到一半回头，比不走更伤。」主教的人在廊下远远看着，手里拿着名册，像是只等一个结果。
<br><br>
炭床昨夜被风吹塌了一角，靠里的炭堆得高，靠外的又太薄。若就这么让人走，重心一偏，脚背会陷进火里。修女把铁耙递给你，说铺炭要看风向，也要看炭块的大小；大块垫底，小块盖面，耙齿不能拖得太快，不然火星会飞。池边的石板上还留着一圈深色的水渍，是上一场雨后没有擦干的。你若自己不敢踩火，把炭床铺稳，也算替人挡了一半的险。
<br><br>
铁耙在炭床上拖过时，火星从齿缝里跳出来，落在石槽边缘就灭了。修女让你先试风向：把手背贴在池边，哪一边烫得厉害，炭就往哪一边堆。朝圣者一直没说话，只把石片在掌心里翻来覆去；约旦看了他/她一眼，又看向你，像是在等一个比火更稳的答案。廊下的名册被风翻过一页，纸角啪地合上。远处钟楼响了，声音落进池子里，被热气顶得有些发闷。你把大块炭挑到迎风的一侧，小块铺在中间，耙齿压着炭面慢慢抹平。修女蹲下来看了看，说还差一层细灰，脚踩上去才不会陷。你把铁耙靠在池边，手掌被木柄磨得发红；修女递来一块湿布，说先把脚底擦干，再踩上去才不会打滑。朝圣者终于把石片收进怀里，朝你点了点头。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 0) gte 11000>><<link [[赤足过火 (0:12)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><<pain 2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[赤足过火 (0:12)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<stress 7>><<pain 4>><<tiredness 3>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($science or 0) gte 220>><<link [[铺平炭床 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[铺平炭床 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 1>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 160>><<link [[添炭备池 (0:08)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<money -160>><<pass 8>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">添炭备池 (0:08)（钱不够）</span><</if>><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回杂役水牌 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Season Extra [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
杂役廊石板上的第七枚铜钩，今天挂了一块新牌。牌上没有刻字，只用炭条写了「节令」两个字，底下画着一道随季节弯折的线。老修士说，这块牌每年换四回，春天挂藤，夏天挂水，秋天挂谷，冬天挂冰；挂上什么，杂役廊就补什么。窗外的天色已经变了，屋里能听见风从檐角绕过去的声音，炭盆里的火也跟着忽明忽暗。
<br><br>
此刻是 <<if Time.season is "spring">>春天，墙根的苔藓吸饱了水，后园的土一踩一个浅坑<<elseif Time.season is "summer">>夏天，彩窗把日头烤得发白，长椅的木头摸上去黏手<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">>秋天，狼街的落叶贴着门槛打旋，风里有葡萄发酵的酸气<<elseif Time.season is "winter">>冬天，阶前的薄冰亮得像一层釉，进门的人都要扶一把墙<<else>>个节令含混的日子，云压得低，殿里殿外一个颜色<</if>>。门外的天色<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>阴沉，雨丝斜斜打在廊柱上，汇成细流往阶下淌<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "snow">>发白，雪片落在石阶上，踩过的地方很快又平了<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "none">>亮得刺眼，钟塔的尖顶像被人擦过一遍<<else>>发灰，雾气贴着墙根游走，几步外就看不清了<</if>>。雾潮水尺停在 <<print ($mpFogTide or 0)>>；铜牌上另有两行旧刻，写着进度 <<print $mpLocProgress_Temple>>，经手之事 <<print $mpLocEvents_Temple>>。节令差事都有一样的规矩：办妥了在牌背添一道刻痕，办砸了不扣工钱，只把疲累留给自己。
<br><br>
<<if Time.season is "spring">>
开春的差事在后园。土刚化冻，踩下去会陷进半个指节。修女把留种的麦粒摊在竹匾里，瘪粒、草籽和碎壳混作一团；葡萄架下的麻绳被雪水沤烂，风一吹，整排架子都在晃。<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨点打在瓦檐上，汇成一股细流，顺着裂开的陶管往廊下灌，接水的缸已经满了大半，再不管就要漫过门槛。<<else>>日头不烈，正适合把受潮的谱本搬到廊下摊开，也适合把藤架底下的旧土翻一遍。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">><<mpcarryicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220>><<link [[接檐水入缸 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[接檐水入缸 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><<else>><<mpherbicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<link [[挑拣春播麦种 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[挑拣春播麦种 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><</if>><br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 150>><<link [[添买麻绳修架 (0:08)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<money -150>><<pass 8>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">添买麻绳修架 (0:08)（钱不够）</span><</if>>
<<elseif Time.season is "summer">>
入夏后，前殿像一口扣住的热锅。彩窗把日头滤成一片晃眼的白，长椅的接缝被晒得发黏，手肘一压就留下一道浅印，水罐一天要添好几回。<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨来得急，彩窗上的积灰被水一泡，正好擦；可檐口也在漏，得拿木盆接住，别让水淌到长椅上。<<else>>井台边的石板上晒得发烫，井绳却还是凉的；把水汲上来，兑一点薄荷，能救回半个前殿的人。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">><<investigateicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<link [[趁雨擦彩窗 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[趁雨擦彩窗 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><<else>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 0) gte 11000>><<link [[汲井水镇殿 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[汲井水镇殿 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 3>><</link>><</if>><</if>><br>
<<if ($money or 0) gte 150>><<link [[添买井绳水桶 (0:08)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<money -150>><<pass 8>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">添买井绳水桶 (0:08)（钱不够）</span><</if>>
<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">>
秋风一起，狼街的落叶就往门槛里卷。祭坛换上了深色帷布，供桌要摆第一捆不脱粒的谷子；后园的葡萄摘完了，藤上只剩几片发黄的叶子。<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨来得不是时候，帷布刚挂上去就被打湿，得赶在霉斑生出来之前收进来烘着。<<else>>天高风干，谷捆在场上晒得正好，抬上供桌时不能掉穗。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220>><<link [[抢收祭坛帷布 (0:08)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[抢收祭坛帷布 (0:08)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 8>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><<else>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 0) gte 11000>><<link [[抬谷捆上供桌 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[抬谷捆上供桌 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 3>><</link>><</if>><</if>><br>
<<if ($money or 0) gte 180>><<link [[添买新帷布 (0:08)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<money -180>><<pass 8>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">添买新帷布 (0:08)（钱不够）</span><</if>>
<<elseif Time.season is "winter">>
入冬后，门前的石阶覆着一层薄冰，来望晨祷的人得贴着墙根，脚底蹭着地往前移。殿里烧起了炭盆，窗缝却还没封严，风从彩窗的铅条缝里钻进来，把烛火吹得东倒西歪。<<if Weather.precipitation is "snow">>积雪压了一整夜，冰面藏在雪底下，脚踩上去最难提防；先撒炉灰，再顺着石阶一级级往下刮。<<else>>天干冷，窗纸被风扯出细口，若不及早糊上，夜里的寒气会把水罐冻裂。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "snow">><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 380>><<link [[铲阶前薄冰 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[铲阶前薄冰 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 1>><</link>><</if>><<else>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<link [[封窗缝挡风 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[封窗缝挡风 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><</if>><br>
<<if ($money or 0) gte 160>><<link [[添买炭盆 (0:08)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<money -160>><<pass 8>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">添买炭盆 (0:08)（钱不够）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
节令牌上的炭条被湿气洇花了，老修士说今天挂哪一块都行，只看你手上有什么。后园、井台、供桌和石阶都等着人，炭盆里的火却只剩一点红。
<br><br>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 380>><<link [[替杂役廊打杂 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[替杂役廊打杂 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>>
<</if>>
